@115858 @AppleSupport hey guys, I recently receive this email and I just want to know if this is real or fake...looks kind a unreal for me https://t.co/Gvxg1c21uH @115858 @AppleSupport I’m a little worried to be honest...so i appreciate the support with my doubt, because I don’t want to be in trouble with my account. Tks @115858 @AppleSupport After receive that email, I checked all the info in settings, iCloud and all that I receive is a message like this...please help!😢 https://t.co/at1VSVC8Hj @115858 @AppleSupport Beyond all that, my phone is working normally...please give some information and assistance about this situation. Tks 🙏🙏🙏 @115858 @AppleSupport This is what I can see about the email address after hit in the FROM icon of this message...I don’t think is legit... https://t.co/pAUIkWWJnt @115858 @AppleSupport This is the complete information about that email in the last image:

__email__

Help 🙏😢😰 @AppleSupport Thank you so much guys! Indeed, was a phishing email...the link that you send me with the information about was so helpful in this case 👌👍👊

@AppleSupport hi there , i lost my password , how can i reset to my Email? The password you entered to unlock your iPhone backup was incorrect. Please try again. @AppleSupport Oh wow , thanks a lot. But if you can add this feature in reset for removes the encrypted backup password.
it's better,because it's boring to rebuild my screen  apps and my folders, 
Thanks again.
